# Deadline for presenting the movement certificate.

```catala
declaration scope MovementCertificateDeadline:
  input issue_date content date
  output submission_deadline content date
```

## Submission Deadline

The movement certificate must be produced within six months from the date of issue of the original movement certificate.

```catala
scope MovementCertificateDeadline:
  date round down
  definition submission_deadline equals issue_date + 6 month
```